      "anchor": "fluix-tools",
      "text": "$(l:items_blocks_machines/fluix_crystal)Fluix$(/l) tools are similar to iron tools, having 3x the durability and a slightly higher attack damage and mining speed.$(br2)All fluix tools act as if they have at least fortune/looting 1, which is useful before getting access to an enchanting table.$(br2)You will need to make a $(l:items_blocks_machines/fluix_upgrade_smithing_template)Fluix Upgrade$(/l)"
